, "last_played": 1787106431, "avatar": "ff224ed309866597dbef469722b27f73afb27da2"}, "language": "english", "review": "MARK THIS DAY GAMERS! We have finally shown greedy publishers that we will not take their BS and they have listened!", "timestamp_created": 1709941936, "timestamp_updated": 1715101331, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160142645", "author": {"steamid": "76561198352742809", "personaname": "GravyDavy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198352742809/", "num_games_owned": 283, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 2062, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 181, "last_played": 1766174746, "avatar": "f08cbfd6dad9315ca2609bc95d671fd5eff69854"}, "language": "english", "review": "DEMOCRACY!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!", "timestamp_created": 1709941931, "timestamp_updated": 1709941931, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.494537651538848877", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160142640", "author": {"steamid": "76561197971468331", "personaname": "Hatsune Miku", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TsukasaHiiragi/", "num_games_owned": 2574, "num_reviews": 160, "playtime_forever": 1427, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 300, "last_played": 1712283772, "avatar": "f0e6358e0265d871e97e5db9fae9e85a1346ff20"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pro's\n\nIntense action\nDecent gunplay\nLots of unlockable content\nDecent sound effects\nGreat tense atmosphere\n\nCon's\n\nBad servers\nOnline only\nMicrotransactions\nUnreliable gun reloading system\nNot particularly solo-friendly\n\nMinor Issues\n\nCan get repetitive\nAbusive trolls and griefers\nnProtect anticheat\n\nThis is more of a mixed review and since I see more potential positives here, I'd recommend it however the only major reason why I can't recommend HellDivers 2 at this time is very simple, Severe on-going server issues plague HellDivers 2 from being the great game it can be, severe issues have been a somewhat consistent  as outages and other server problems have started since launch and that is most likely due to player congestion and servers not being good enough to handle the load, if you are completely fine with playing with spotty servers that may or may not allow you to connect or run into sporadic unknown errors, then once you are in game you'll enjoy it especially if you have friends who play.\n\nGameplay is a mixture of a horde shooter and an extraction shooter,  with intense firefights against automatons or bugs that somewhat parody Starship Troopers.   Gunplay is pretty good and accurate, with heavy weapons slowing you down, or cumbersome to use whilst moving and plenty of unlockable content although microtransactions are present in game, in the form of Super Credits however they can be earned by playing. \n\nOne issue I don't like is how guns reload, its very inconsistent or unreliable often within a major fire fight where you could tap R to reload and nothing happen, or take extra long to reload and generally is extremely annoying, why can't you just simply reload your gun without any fuss, unfortunately Hell Divers 2 is fairly poor. \n\nOne major concern I do have is mission structure can get repetitive with repeating the same missions, and harder missions require more dedicated teams rather than rando players as the missions definitely get much harder, to the point of raid like precision to complete all but the hardest missions.  A more pressing concern is the typical coop nature of the game,  is that it really caters to established clans/guilds first and foremost, basically if you are Johnny No-Friends or your clan is playing a different game, you are forced to group with randos and the higher level missions really require static teams,  even the harder missions require more teamwork than most games and if you don't have friends who play, you'll be forever stuck playing on easier difficulties, and good luck in trying to join harder difficulty matches without being constantly kicked. \n\nMinor character customization's are available but honestly, they kinder follow Destiny's methods of just unlocking different armor pieces, helmets and capes with the bulk of the customization being strategem loadouts which require inputting select directions to call down airstrikes or to resurrect team mates if they get one shotted, which can happen and so does accidental friendly fire. \n\nOverall, I think once the developers have fixed the server issues and get past these problems, the game would be significantly better and more enjoyable.  \n", "timestamp_created": 1709941921, "timestamp_updated": 1710383827, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.505462348461151123", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160142631", "author": {"steamid": "76561198007575636", "personaname": "flippySTEVE", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/flippySTEVE/", "num_games_owned": 2879, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 782, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 206, "last_played": 1781038230, "avatar": "0767d0525742f022137ccde7caa0831aed3a54d3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great fun when you're able to play the game. Would highly recommend yo